{"content":[{"c":["SIN*, Wilderness of"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Arid, sandy region in the southwestern part of the Sinai peninsula, described in the Bible as being “between Elim and Sinai” (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.16.1","r":"Exod.16.1","rawR":"Exod.16.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.16.1","value":"Exod.16.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 16:1"},"). It is mentioned only four times in the Bible (",{"href":"?bref=Exod.16.1","r":"Exod.16.1","rawR":"Exod.16.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.16.1","value":"Exod.16.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 16:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.17.1","r":"Exod.17.1","rawR":"Exod.17.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.17.1","value":"Exod.17.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"17:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Num.33.11-12","r":"Num.33.11-12","rawR":"Num.33.11-12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.33.11-12","value":"Num.33.11-12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 33:11-12"},") in itineraries of the exodus from Egypt. The wilderness of Sin lies to the southeast of Elim, which generally is regarded as the Wadi Gharandel."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=SinaSinai_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"SinaSinai_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"SinaSinai_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Sina, Sinai"},"; ",{"href":"?item=WildernessWanderings_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"WildernessWanderings_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"WildernessWanderings_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Wilderness Wanderings"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"SinWildernessof","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ex 16:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.16.1","rawQueryValue":"Exod.16.1","sourceRefExact":"Exod.16.1"},{"anchorText":"Ex 16:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionar